{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は横浜で個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪が完全に治りきらず\nみなさんには迷惑をかけてしまいました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"復活してからは徐々によくなっていって\nただ声帯が腫れているので\n喋るトーンが低かったり\nうまく喋れなかったりで\n今日げんきないねーーーってたくさんいわれた(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"げんきだよ！げんきはげんきなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからみなさん、心配なさらずに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週というか6日後にも\n個別握手会があるから\nその時には完全に治さないとね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は去年放送された\n乃木中の「留守番告白」企画の時の\nスタジオで着てたワンピース！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この後すぐ、ダウンしてしまい\n写メ撮り忘れちゃいました(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのワンピースに、伊織と一緒に買った\nマスタードカラーのニット帽！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部は、MELANTRICK HEMLIGHETの\nワンピース！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着たのはワンピースなんだけど\n同じ模様のトップスバージョンもあって\nそのトップスは、\nMELANTRICK HEMLIGHETの\nカタログ撮影の時に着たの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とペアで撮影だったとき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部は伊織とお揃いの色違いのお洋服に\n色違いのチョーカー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型もかわいくしてもらったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/23/3390986/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は、白いニットに\nマスタード色のスカートに\nベレー帽！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真は撮り忘れちゃいました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また着たとき載せるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週の幕張での個別握手会は\nハロウィン前ということで\n仮装します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を着るかはおたのしみにー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}